    "detailed_description": "\u300aOnly Down\u300b is a platform jumping parkour game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is produced by the independent studio OldCat Digital Studio, with a single person named OldCat.\u300aOnly Down\u300b, as the name suggests, means players move from the sky to the ground or below, ultimately obtaining the treasure.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn \u300aOnly Down\u300b, players need to jump through layers of obstacles and traps, and also open two gates to continue moving forward. The game has a certain level of difficulty, and I hope players enjoy it. There is drop damage in the game, and it is impossible to take shortcuts.",
